Subject: [PATCH] perf(dsv41): add opt-in gfx942 HIP sparse attention

Route BF16 two-source attention to the standalone kernel from ROCm/aiter 3dcbc414ca0bc0c061a7073cd4dfaa10de97f550. Fuse inverse RoPE for BF16 output projection and keep the existing quantized projection path.

Signed-off-by: TianHao65 <283868507+TianHao65@users.noreply.github.com>
